  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : Length of latus rectum \\(=2 \\frac{b^2}{a}=\\frac{2 \\times 16}{5}=\\frac{32}{5}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& 16 x^2+25 y^2=400 \\\\\n& \\frac{x^2}{25}+\\frac{y^2}{16}=1 \\\\\n& a^2=25 ; b^2=16\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
